# 统一按 LF 存文本，避免 Windows 上混入 CRLF 后产生「整文件都改了」的假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 批处理必须保留 CRLF：cmd.exe 解析 LF 结尾的 .bat 时，goto / label 会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 大体积二进制：禁止行尾转换与文本合并
*.onnx binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.rar binary
